{"case_id":"C009","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["entry point","API protocol","state","configuration","input semantics","attack surface"],"commit_induced":"YES","maintenance_needed":true,"confidence":99,"affected_functions":["decoder.transform_io?","decoder.do_transform_io?","decoder.decode_block_header_with_padding?","decoder.decode_block_header_sans_padding?","decoder.set_quirk!","decoder.get_quirk","decoder.dst_history_retain_length"],"reason":"S1 adds the new public std/xz decoder and its XZ/LZMA2 parsing attack surface, but H0 exclusively initializes and drives wuffs_json__decoder and wuffs_aux::DecodeJson. Consequently, S1 + H0 cannot invoke decoder.transform_io?, exercise its streaming suspension protocol and destination-history requirements, control base.QUIRK_IGNORE_CHECKSUM, or supply XZ-specific headers, blocks, filters, padding, and checksums. S0 had no matching declaration, so this unreachable production surface was introduced by the commit rather than being a historical gap.","evidence":["The production diff creates the new file std/xz/decode_xz.wuffs and defines pub struct decoder? implements base.io_transformer.","The new public entry point decoder.transform_io? delegates to decoder.do_transform_io? and handles base.\"$short read\" plus closed-input state.","decoder.do_transform_io? parses XZ magic, stream flags, block data, padding, and CRC-32/CRC-64/SHA-256 checksum modes while delegating compressed data to this.lzma.transform_io?.","decoder.decode_block_header_sans_padding? handles filter count, optional sizes, the LZMA2 filter ID 0x21, and lzma.QUIRK_FORMAT_EXTENSION.","decoder.set_quirk! exposes base.QUIRK_IGNORE_CHECKSUM, creating a configuration branch absent from H0.","H0 defines only WUFFS_CONFIG__MODULE__JSON and WUFFS_CONFIG__MODULE__AUX__JSON, and its exercised entry points are wuffs_json__decoder__decode_tokens and wuffs_aux::DecodeJson.","The selected S0 context states that there was no matching declaration, whereas S1 contains the new decoder API."],"recommended_action":"Add an XZ-specific fuzz harness that initializes the new xz.decoder, drives decoder.transform_io? across short-read and short-write resumptions with controlled source and destination limits/history, varies base.QUIRK_IGNORE_CHECKSUM, and feeds arbitrary bytes to the XZ header, block-header, LZMA2, padding, and checksum paths."}
